            </note>
            <note corresp="#d185-f2" n="2" xml:id="d185-f2-content">
                <p>Tab A is a copy of the “Draft Convention for the Denuclearization of the African
                    Continent”; not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d185-f3" n="3" xml:id="d185-f3-content">
                <p>Tab B is JCSM–577–64, July 2, 1964; not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d185-f4" n="4" xml:id="d185-f4-content">
                <p>Tab C is a June 19, 1964, letter from Deputy Under Secretary of State for
                    Political Affairs U. Alexis Johnson; not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d185-f5" n="5" xml:id="d185-f5-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d185-f6" n="6" xml:id="d185-f6-content">
                <p>Secretary McNamara initialed his approval on July 11.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
